      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-1",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "That's fantastic news, Donald! Securing initial clients is indeed a major achievement, especially considering the transition from your previous career in technology to political consulting. It's clear that your innovative spirit and active thinking have paid off. Leveraging your network, including key contacts like MooreSandra and GonzalezMary, was a smart move. They must have been invaluable in connecting you with political campaigns seeking strategic advice. By the way, I remember you expressing gratitude for the support from your family during the establishment of your firm. It's always wonderful to have family backing you up. How do you plan to continue nurturing these relationships for sustained success?",
