        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/348492a7-cfe4-ee1d-73c3-c276d6ba8277/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/2/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-3",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "Maintaining and nurturing these relationships is key, especially in the political consulting arena where connections can make all the difference. Your gratitude for the support from key contacts in your network is well-placed, as they have played pivotal roles in your success. As you brainstorm strategies for continued growth, you might consider balancing rapid expansion and immediate impact with sustainable growth and influence. This dual approach could help you establish a solid foundation while also making a noticeable impact in the field. How are you balancing these strategies?",
